          "guid": "mryk92sdqwtkue87",
          "message": {
            "text": "`>= 0`, not `> 0`: 0 is a MEANINGFUL value for the guard thresholds (`minIdleMs`/`idleMs`/`headroomFloorBytes` = 'disable this guard'). The original `> 0` silently rejected 0 and fell back to the 30s default — which masked the cap-eviction test failure (a just-opened cluster stayed inside the recency guard). `maxOpen` is clamped to a floor of 2 and the sweep interval to 1s separately, since 0 is nonsensical for those.",
            "markdown": "`>= 0`, not `> 0`: 0 is a MEANINGFUL value for the guard thresholds (`minIdleMs`/`idleMs`/`headroomFloorBytes` = 'disable this guard'). The original `> 0` silently rejected 0 and fell back to the 30s default — which masked the cap-eviction test failure (a just-opened cluster stayed inside the recency guard). `maxOpen` is clamped to a floor of 2 and the sweep interval to 1s separately, since 0 is nonsensical for those."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/db/clusterEviction.ts"
                },
                "region": {
